# GekkoNet (BSD-2-Clause, with zpp_bits, MIT): a pinned copy of the library sources for the experimental rollback netcode; no asio
!/installer/port/jsp/gekkonet/
!/installer/port/jsp/gekkonet/**/
!/installer/port/jsp/gekkonet/**/*.h
!/installer/port/jsp/gekkonet/**/*.cpp
!/installer/port/jsp/gekkonet/**/LICENSE
!/installer/port/jsp/gekkonet/PIN.md
!/installer/port/patches/
/installer/port/patches/*
!/installer/port/patches/*.patch
